>>
endobj
260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 161 0 R
/E (During the physical security walkthrough at KLIA1, the network room was observed to be protected using only a card-based access control system. No biometric authentication or secondary verification mechanism was implemented at the entrance. Access to the network room relied solely on possession of an authorised access card.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
