262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 161 0 R
/E (Direct observation during the site visit showed that a card access reader was installed at the network room entrance, with no biometric scanner, keypad, or additional authentication device present. This indicates that physical access control for the network room is limited to single-factor authentication.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
