347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (This finding is supported by direct observation during the site walkthrough, where access-controlled entry points were observed without active measures to prevent tailgating. Informal interview responses and the physical security audit checklist further indicate reliance on card-based access control without supplementary enforcement mechanisms or continuous monitoring.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
